@documentId = paste_document_id_here

### 1. Check Server Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Check App Version for Force Update Gate
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/system/version?version_code=1

### 3. Employee Login (By Mobile Number, Username, or Email)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "8709782651",
  "password": "S@j@n_123",
  "device_hardware_id": "android_pixel_hw_001",
  "device_brand": "Google",
  "device_model": "Pixel 8",
  "os_version": "Android 15"
}

### 4. Rotate Refresh Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": "{{sessionId}}",
  "refresh_token": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 5. Get Employee Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 6. Update Employee Profile (Set One-Time DOB, Username, Address, Avatar)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "sajan",
  "dob": "2001-08-12",
  "address": "Main Market Road, Saharsa, Bihar",
  "avatar_url": "https://api.dicebear.com/9.x/adventurer/png?seed=Sajan"
}

### 7. Request 6-Digit Email OTP to Link Email Address
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profile/email/send-otp
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "stkrfx@gmail.com"
}

### 8. Verify 6-Digit Email OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profile/email/verify-otp
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "stkrfx@gmail.com",
  "otp_code": "834947"
}

### 9. Get Attendance Calendar & Monthly Summary (Current + Previous 2 Months)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/attendance
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 10. Upload Identity Document (PAN, Voter ID, Driving License, or Aadhaar)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "IDENTITY",
  "document_type": "PAN",
  "document_number": "ABCDE1234F",
  "file_url": "https://example.com/uploads/pan-card.jpg",
  "mime_type": "image/jpeg"
}

### 11. Upload Educational Certificate (Requires Institution, Start Date, End Date)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "CERTIFICATE",
  "document_type": "GRADUATION",
  "document_number": "CERT-2026-9981",
  "institution_name": "IGNOU",
  "start_date": "2023-07-01",
  "end_date": "2026-06-30",
  "file_url": "https://example.com/uploads/graduation-cert.pdf",
  "mime_type": "application/pdf"
}

### 12. List All Uploaded Documents & Certificates
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 13. Delete an Uploaded Document
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents/{{documentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 14. List Notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 15. Mark All Notifications as Read
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 16. Change Password
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profile/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "current_password": "EmployeePass123",
  "new_password": "EmployeeNewPass456"
}

### 17. List All Active Logged-In Phones for This Employee
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profile/devices
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 18. Logout All Other Phones (Except Current Phone)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profile/devices/logout-others
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 19. Logout Current Phone
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profile/devices/logout-current
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
